<<<
iodine. For this, as well as for the three parallel element-names bromine, chlorine, & fluorine, the OED prefers the sound -in, with -in allowed as alternative. Popular use is almost universally for -in in iodine, but varies in the other three.
===
**iodine.** For this, as well as for the three parallel element-names *bromine, chlorine,* & *fluorine,* the OED prefers the sound -ĭn, with -ĭn allowed as alternative. Popular use is almost universally for -ĭn in *iodine,* but varies in the other three.
>>>

