<<<
such as abolishment, admonishment, pollutement, incitation, & punition, should not be lightly resorted to when abolition, admonition, pollution, incitement, & punishment, are to hand.
===
such as *abolishment, admonishment, pollutement, incitation,* & *punition,* should not be lightly resorted to when *abolition, admonition, pollution, incitement,* & *punishment,* are to hand.
